    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Etherburn is a student game and offers Souls-like gameplay in a medieval dark fantasy setting. Play as a revived Hero, a legendary knight who's name is lost to time. Your goal is to explore and escape the dungeon on one of many Routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/0809cbf832a63b2a78417d0eecdd5668.avif?t=1743246037\" width=800 height=67 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your perilious Journey you will encounter Foes and might even die in Combat against them. But Death is not the End: The Dungeon is filled with the life-giving Powers of Ether - bringing you and your Enemies back to life in due time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/8ba1c3ce96781f0652da30cffbbcc2ff.avif?t=1743246037\" width=800 height=67 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected Dungeon - filled with different Biomes and Areas to explore. Discover different parts of the Dungeon in a medieval dark fantasy setting in the attempt to find the right path to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/bdcd619203be9de4ff8481ec36b3e1e3.avif?t=1743246037\" width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master various weapons and unleash deadly attacks to defeat your enemies. Weaken your foes and finish them off with brutal executions. Unlock new weapons as you journey through the Dungeon - looking for a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Etherburn is a student game and offers Souls-like gameplay in a medieval dark fantasy setting. Play as a revived Hero, a legendary knight who's name is lost to time. Your goal is to explore and escape the dungeon on one of many Routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/0809cbf832a63b2a78417d0eecdd5668.avif?t=1743246037\" width=800 height=67 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your perilious Journey you will encounter Foes and might even die in Combat against them. But Death is not the End: The Dungeon is filled with the life-giving Powers of Ether - bringing you and your Enemies back to life in due time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/8ba1c3ce96781f0652da30cffbbcc2ff.avif?t=1743246037\" width=800 height=67 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected Dungeon - filled with different Biomes and Areas to explore. Discover different parts of the Dungeon in a medieval dark fantasy setting in the attempt to find the right path to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/bdcd619203be9de4ff8481ec36b3e1e3.avif?t=1743246037\" width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master various weapons and unleash deadly attacks to defeat your enemies. Weaken your foes and finish them off with brutal executions. Unlock new weapons as you journey through the Dungeon - looking for a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
